# Title: Tamper Windows Defender Remove-MpPreference
# ID: 07e3cb2c-0608-410d-be4b-1511cb1a0448
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-05
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects attempts to remove Windows Defender configurations using the 'MpPreference' cmdlet
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_exec="*Remove-MpPreference*") AND ((process_exec="*-ControlledFolderAccessProtectedFolders *" OR process_exec="*-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Ids *" OR process_exec="*-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Actions *" OR process_exec="*-CheckForSignaturesBeforeRunningScan *")))
